// Solid Eleven's strings for the engine's tools (issue #60): the sounds'
// captions, which the game draws from the baked `i18n/en-US` table, and the
// pause screen's keys (`ui/pause.ui.ron`), which the game reads through its
// own tables (`ui::i18n::tr`) — kept equal to them here so `ui check` and
// `access check` measure the real texts. The font is upper case and has no
// brackets (`fonts/se_ui`'s `chars`).
Strings(
    lang: "en-US",
    entries: {
        "pause.title": "PAUSED",
        "pause.resume": "RESUME",
        "pause.substitute": "SUBSTITUTE",
        "pause.quit": "QUIT MATCH",
        "cap.whistle": "WHISTLE!",
        "cap.cheer": "CROWD CHEERS",
        "cap.ooh": "CROWD: OOH!",
        "cap.post": "OFF THE POST",
    },
)
